=== layout: one-panel

# *In-Person Exam Rules*

@body

- Part 1\: multiple choice and matching
- ZipGrade bubble answer form
- Variations on assignment and quiz questions
- Questions sorted by lecture
- Fill one bubble completely for each answer

=== layout: one-panel

# *What to Bring to the Exam*

@body

- Bring a notecard or full sheet of paper as a help sheet
- Dr. Voss provides the Punnett square help sheet
- No electronics or calculators

=== layout: one-panel

# *Reviewing Old Quiz Questions*

@body

- Review a quiz after everyone has completed it
- In Blackboard, open your quiz score in the gradebook
- Select the attempt to review your answers

